the Open Database License 1.0: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

Any rights in individual contents of the database are licensed under the Database Contents
License 1.0: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/dbcl/1-0/

The published list (`recipes.json`, compiled from `stations/`) is the same database under the same
licences.

Not covered by these licences:
* `fixtures/`: excerpts of third-party web pages, kept only to test the recipes. They belong to
  their respective owners.
* `recipe.schema.json` and the tooling in `scripts/` and `.github/`: Mozilla Public License 2.0,
  like the Soundfolk app (https://github.com/getsoundfolk/soundfolk).
